                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64a629bd-fdc5-4f56-af12-a05ec7a6985e",
                                                "sense_id": "33bc09ea-0e1f-3a35-97bf-5e211f7a0a81",
                                                "text": "A quarter of a million strong in 1680, the clergy was only half as large in 1789. The unpopular regular clergy were the worst affected."
