                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c940c3bd-23f2-4b12-8f46-9d90987b103d",
                                                "sense_id": "53f0034c-ca76-378a-9ea6-257bf90cdbbf",
                                                "text": "He made regular visits to go see his mother."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "abded4e0-d1b8-38f6-b462-26d39b83e17e",
                                        "entry_id": "bfa38e96-610f-38c8-9a77-8502cb61e6f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Following a set or common pattern; according to the normal rules of a given language."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e266c024-cce7-48a2-b34d-8bfc7b9333a1",
                                                "sense_id": "abded4e0-d1b8-38f6-b462-26d39b83e17e",
                                                "text": "\"Walked\" is the past tense of the regular verb \"to walk\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6681cfd1-ba79-3373-952c-6fb8b39d35f3",
                                        "entry_id": "bfa38e96-610f-38c8-9a77-8502cb61e6f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the expected characteristics or appearances; normal, ordinary, standard."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3b08fb6-534b-4ffc-ac1f-4962d74e4139",
                                                "sense_id": "6681cfd1-ba79-3373-952c-6fb8b39d35f3",
                                                "text": "“I don’t see how you can write and act such splendid things, Jo. You’re a regular Shakespeare!” exclaimed Beth, who firmly believed that her sisters were gifted with wonderful genius in all things."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab5c4296-33ce-4f6a-af98-d1d86f9ad76d",
                                                "sense_id": "6681cfd1-ba79-3373-952c-6fb8b39d35f3",
                                                "text": "For a spell we done pretty well. Then there came a reg'lar terror of a sou'wester same as you don't get one summer in a thousand, and blowed the shanty flat and ripped about half of the weir poles out of the sand."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f48e49ed-7ab0-35ed-8469-f2e025c8f76f",
                                        "entry_id": "bfa38e96-610f-38c8-9a77-8502cb61e6f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Permanently organised; being part of a set professional body of troops."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d161d82-6b36-3d21-be1b-c7cc342855e1",
                                        "entry_id": "bfa38e96-610f-38c8-9a77-8502cb61e6f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having bowel movements or menstrual periods at constant intervals in the expected way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d91570e5-11f0-4941-b0c8-022962e0c6f8",
                                                "sense_id": "1d161d82-6b36-3d21-be1b-c7cc342855e1",
                                                "text": "Maintaining a high-fibre diet keeps you regular."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0546aa0-1eae-4f43-8dc3-0f9dedc6084f",
                                                "sense_id": "1d161d82-6b36-3d21-be1b-c7cc342855e1",
                                                "text": "Gulls cawed and wheeled overhead, dropping splatty white cluster bombs on rooftops and pavements. Goodness knows what those gulls eat, but it certainly keeps them regular."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a927dfc-8d71-3263-9b0f-fff245d93b0f",
                                        "entry_id": "bfa38e96-610f-38c8-9a77-8502cb61e6f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exemplary; excellent example of; utter, downright."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9af71386-3758-454d-8834-2da945d90a3c",
                                                "sense_id": "9a927dfc-8d71-3263-9b0f-fff245d93b0f",
                                                "text": "a regular genius; a regular John Bull"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7aedbfd-9210-47d5-92dc-c758bb15a36c",
                                                "sense_id": "9a927dfc-8d71-3263-9b0f-fff245d93b0f",
                                                "text": "Don't worry, boy. We're gonna set you straight. By tomorrow morning, you'll be a regular Burt Reynolds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76a1f2ab-db0b-3c4f-9b78-1b2ea1a58850",
                                        "entry_id": "bfa38e96-610f-38c8-9a77-8502cb61e6f5",
